# #283 stuck-save heal route. Two owned processes, two builds, one save.
# Session one runs on a build WITHOUT the fix: on the 0.3.9 hotfix branch, a clean checkout of the
# branch's own detector commit, whose staged runtime is the published 0.3.8 runtime and whose
# harness and tools are this tree's (Tools/persona_reload_heal.py: an earlier commit of this
# history; FIX_NEW and FIX_CHANGED in their pre-fix form, at most RELEASE_METADATA beside them,
# the identical harness and identical tools apart from host tests, all proved before launch).
# Name it with TAF_RELOAD_SOURCE_TREE. It runs the tier-upgrade legs and the third ordinary wait
# into the retired handover stall, journals the fresh after-wait evidence and saves the stall for
# real; its seal reports of that stall are the defect evidence.
# Session two cold-loads that exact save in a fresh descendant profile whose staged runtime comes
# from THIS tree (prepare-scenario-load.py --runtime), resumes 2400 ordinary turns, and must show
# the one readmission line, the completed handover, the finished tent-row with the carried
# yielding mark, a seal reading without a fault and a second real save. Before its readmission
# line the only diagnostic it may carry is the seal's report of the loaded stall itself.
# Seed: TAF_PERSONA_SEED, else #922453088 (the 4ea54bb9 siting inside the heart's survey).
# Synthetic setup is the tier-upgrade persona's, disclosed there. Not ordinary-play acceptance.
DESCRIPTION=save a paid tent renovate stuck by #283 on an unfixed build, cold-load it on the fix, heal and save again
REQUEST=founding-first-city
SCRIPT=reload-descendant renovate-heal 8.22@40,12
EXPECT=RELOAD-COMPLETE
SET=reload,save-load,tier-upgrade
